                        <span>Sind gewerbliche Reinigungen versichert?</span>
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 ml-2 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
